{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2022-10", "window": 1, "start_date": 1664582400, "end_date": 1665187199, "month_true_total": 1329, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 19:03:58 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "123509408", "author": {"steamid": "76561197990634146", "personaname": "Non Brand Skrubbe", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197990634146/", "num_games_owned": 347, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 105988, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 99297, "last_played": 1714229271, "avatar": "7c3db9a84d1d387c7bdf1736542d8281ea058a56"}, "language": "english", "review": "This was a rough one to make, despite not really playing anymore and when i do it's only for a few missions before the horrible grind makes me quit, i still love the game and looking back, seeing how i slowly played less and less is heartbreaking, but after the New War and the same open world \"content\" that's basically the same as the last one, i decided now was the time.\n\nThis will be the TLDR version since this would be several pages long if i had to write what i thought and felt about the game in full.\n\nWarframe is a game with a fun combat system that majorly lost its way, a game with a world that once seemed so weird and unique, now filled with story missions riddled with plot holes, or no real plot at all. Content that take several years longer to release than it should and then turns out to be copy pasted old content with a new coat of paint. A game with increasingly bloated items and loot tables whose entire premise is to make it a huge frustrating, boring, confusingly soul sucking unfun grind as possible, intentionally made this way by the developers, to make you pay to skip the grind. A game where you pay to skip playing the game.", "timestamp_created": 1665186971, "timestamp_updated": 1665186971, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.513148069381713867", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "123509149", "author": {"steamid": "76561199229494449", "personaname": "galacticburden", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/galacticburden1992/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 3595, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3089, "last_played": 1666255107, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "yes\n", "timestamp_created": 1665186457, "timestamp_updated": 1665186457, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "123508311", "author": {"steamid": "76561199135266572", "personaname": "pumablank", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/pumablank/", "num_games_owned": 219, "num_reviews": 52, "playtime_forever": 5581, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5522, "last_played": 1694733177, "avatar": "f8ddd81075d42a4b16e7020bb6932e637ebac857"}, "language": "english", "review": "good game", "timestamp_created": 1665184841, "timestamp_updated": 1665184841, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "123507797", "author": {"steamid": "76561198429670521", "personaname": "